after the first trailer for the batman  introduced us to the newest version of  bruce wayne played by robert pattinson  the second trailer has followed it up to  give us an even better look at the  upcoming superhero flick which will  release exclusively in theaters on march  4th  the second trailer continues with the  epic scope established by the first  while diving more into the dark cd plot  the riddler is on a killing spree  targeting the elite of gotham but it's  clear from the way bruce wayne is  targeted that there's more going on here  than meets the eye it's easy to overlook  certain details among all of the action  and the budding romance between bruce  and zoe kravitz's selena kyle some of  them may prove to be more important than  others once the film finally comes out  but for now here are some extra details  you may want to give a second look  during your trailer re-watch at one  point in the trailer the riddler  seemingly taunts batman assuring him  that he plays an integral role in his  reign of carnage but when batman asks  what role that is riddler responds  oh you're really not as smart as i  thought you were  bruce  wayne  granted this could be a result of some  clever audio editing but it does sound  as if riddler knows that batman is bruce  wayne this would fit in well with the  comics and the story line for hush  riddler is one of the few villains in  gotham to know batman's secret identity  the batman trailer also suggests bruce  wayne will have a dark night of the soul  when revelations come to light the  trailer depicts bruce and alfred having  a heated conversation about alfred's  years-long deception given how riddler  appears to be targeting gotham's elite  class it would make the most sense for  alfred's secret to somehow factor into  bruce's parents there's no shortage of  clandestine organizations in the comics  that seek to make the city a more  profitable space and the most likely  culprit for the organization related to  mr and mrs wayne would be the court of  owls that agency was hinted at in the  first teaser and there are definitely  enough clues in the recent footage to  suggest they could factor into the plot  somehow then again it's always possible  the court of owls will remain on the  sidelines to be used for a possible  sequel to the batman by night bruce  wayne gives back to gotham as its dark  protector batman but by day bruce wayne  normally gives back to the city in other  ways from the comics to cartoons bruce  wayne has been a philanthropist often  hosting charity drives to give back to  the city batman may be an immediate fix  to clean up the streets but bruce wayne  aims to invest in long-term solutions to  protect the city it's the latter  identity that's seemingly fallen by the  wayside at least according to the latest  trailer for the batman mayoral candidate  bella rial tells bruce you know you  really could be doing more for this city  my family has a history of philanthropy  but as far as i can tell you're not  doing anything  it's in stark contrast to the bruce  wayne audiences usually know but it  could all be a setup this is still a  young version of bruce wayne we're  seeing who's only been batman for a  relatively short period of time it makes  sense given the story will draw  influence from batman year one so bruce  is still obviously trying to get a  handle on balancing his public and  private personas the marketing materials  for the batman so far have given us good  looks at most of the main cast but paul  dayno who plays riddler hasn't been  shown a great deal there are plenty of  shots of him unravelling a roll of duct  tape and speaking ominously but he's  always shown with something over his  face even in the scene in the diner that  presumably features riddler unmasked  getting arrested his face is blocked  from view is there more to riddler than  meets the eye seeing how this version of  the riddler takes some obvious cues from  real life serial killer the zodiac  perhaps it makes sense for riddler to  have an air of mystery around him too  there's still much we don't know about  the upcoming the batman and that's just  the way many fans would like it all will  be revealed when the movie comes out on  march 4th 2022  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

